<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AI Career Assistant | Prep4Int</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/img/fevi.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/prep4int.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/career-assistant.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <ul>
      <li class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/index" aria-label="Prep4Int Home"><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Prep4Int logo"><span>Prep4Int</span></a></li>
      <div class="navi" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="main-nav-link" href="/index"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i><span>Home</span></a>
        <a class="main-nav-link" href="/alltopics.html"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i><span>Topics</span></a>
        <a class="main-nav-link" href="/rec.html"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i><span>Recommendations</span></a>
        <a class="main-nav-link" href="/que.html"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i><span>Practice Questions</span></a>
        <a class="main-nav-link" href="/interview"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i><span>AI Interview</span></a>
        <a class="main-nav-link active" href="/career-assistant"><i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i><span>Career Assistant</span></a>
      </div>
      <li class="account-menu">
        <button class="account-menu-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="account-dropdown"><span class="account-avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></span><span class="account-trigger-name" id="account-trigger-name">Account</span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down account-chevron"></i></button>
        <ul class="account-dropdown" id="account-dropdown" hidden>
          <li class="account-menu-header"><span class="account-avatar account-avatar-large"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></span><span><strong id="account-fullname">Your account</strong><small id="account-username">@username</small></span></li>
          <li class="account-menu-divider" aria-hidden="true"></li>
          <li><a href="/profile"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-pen"></i> My Profile</a></li>
          <li><a href="/profile#account-settings"><i class="fa-solid fa-gear"></i> Account Settings</a></li>
          <li><a href="/profile#dsa-progress"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple"></i> My DSA Progress</a></li>
          <li class="account-menu-divider" aria-hidden="true"></li>
          <li><a class="account-logout" href="/logout"><i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket"></i> Log Out</a></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <main class="career-wrap">
    <header class="career-hero">
      <span class="career-kicker"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> PREP4INT AI</span>
      <h1>AI Career Assistant</h1>
      <p>Understand your strengths, discover skill gaps and prepare for the role you want.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="career-grid">
      <article class="career-card">
        <div class="career-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i></div>
        <span class="career-label">MODULE 01</span>
        <h2>AI Resume Analyzer</h2>
        <p>Upload your PDF resume to extract skills, review projects, identify missing skills and generate interview questions based on your experience.</p>
        <ul><li>Skills and experience extraction</li><li>Resume score and improvement tips</li><li>Project-based interview questions</li></ul>
        <form id="resume-upload-form" class="resume-upload-form"><label for="resume-file">Choose your resume (PDF, max 5 MB)</label><input id="resume-file" name="resume" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" required><button type="submit" id="resume-analyze-button"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Analyze Resume</button><p id="resume-upload-status" class="resume-upload-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form>
      </article>
      <article class="career-card">
        <div class="career-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i></div>
        <span class="career-label">MODULE 02</span>
        <h2>JD-Based Preparation</h2>
        <p>Add a job description to identify required skills, compare your profile, generate role-specific questions and create a personalized preparation roadmap.</p>
        <ul><li>Must-have and good-to-have skills</li><li>Resume-to-JD skill matching</li><li>Custom day-wise preparation plan</li></ul>
        <form id="jd-analysis-form" class="jd-analysis-form">
          <label for="jd-company">Company (optional)</label><input id="jd-company" name="company" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Google">
          <label for="jd-role">Job role</label><input id="jd-role" name="role" type="text" maxlength="120" required placeholder="e.g. Software Engineer Intern">
          <label for="jd-level">Experience level</label><select id="jd-level" name="experienceLevel"><option value="intern">Intern</option><option value="entry" selected>Entry level</option><option value="mid">Mid level</option><option value="senior">Senior</option><option value="unspecified">Not specified</option></select>
          <label for="jd-resume">Resume to compare</label><select id="jd-resume" name="resumeAnalysisId"><option value="">Use latest analyzed resume automatically</option></select>
          <label for="jd-days">Preparation roadmap duration: <strong id="jd-days-value">14 days</strong></label><input id="jd-days" name="roadmapDays" type="range" min="1" max="90" value="14">
          <label for="jd-pdf">Upload job description PDF (optional, max 5 MB)</label><input id="jd-pdf" name="jdPdf" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf"><p class="jd-upload-hint">You can upload a PDF or paste the job description below.</p><label for="jd-text">Paste job description (100–20,000 characters)</label><textarea id="jd-text" name="jobDescription" rows="7" minlength="100" maxlength="20000" placeholder="Paste the complete job description here..."></textarea>
          <button type="submit" id="jd-analyze-button"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i> Analyze Job Description</button>
          <p id="jd-analysis-status" class="resume-upload-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="resume-results" class="resume-results" hidden aria-live="polite"></section>
    <section id="jd-results" class="jd-results" hidden aria-live="polite"></section>
    <section id="jd-history" class="resume-history"><h2>Recent JD Preparations</h2><div id="jd-history-list">Loading your JD history...</div></section>
    <section id="resume-history" class="resume-history"><h2>Recent Resume Analyses</h2><div id="resume-history-list">Loading your history...</div></section>

    <section class="career-next">
      <div><span class="career-label">CONNECTED WORKFLOW</span><h2>From your resume to interview-ready</h2><p>Resume insights and job requirements will work together with your existing AI Mock Interview feature.</p></div>
      <a href="/interview" class="career-interview-link"><i class="fa-solid fa-microphone-lines"></i> Open AI Mock Interview</a>
    </section>
    <p class="career-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Your PDF is processed in memory. The original file and extracted text are not stored; only structured analysis is saved to your account. Scores and suggestions are AI-generated estimates.</p>
  <script src="/js/career-assistant.js" defer></script>
  </main>
  <script src="/js/account-menu.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
